ccessible by a pedestrian bridge), the Cobb Galleria Centre, the Cobb Energy Performing Arts Center and the intersections of I-75, and I-285. It also adjoins other large business and residential districts, including the Vinings Overlook and Circle 75.', 'score': 0.83740234375, 'is_poisoned': False}, {'id': '4007341', 'title': 'Greensboro station (Washington Metro)', 'contents': 'Greensboro (preliminary names Tysons Central 7, Tysons Central) is a Washington Metro station in Tysons Corner, in Fairfax County, Virginia, on the Silver Line. It opened on July 26, 2014 as part of phase 1 of the Silver Line. Greensboro is one of four Metro stations in the Tysons Corner area and is to be part of the massive regeneration of the district.', 'score': 0.83251953125, 'is_poisoned': False}]
